lim(sin(x)/x, x, 0) -> ?            #= 1
sum(1/k^2, k, 1, ∞) -> ?            #= π^2/6
1/(s^2 + 1) -> invlaplace(s) -> ?   #= sin(t)
```

```calc {#r5 x=0 y=449}
